(We have dispatch_ready true from finalize, candidate_task_profile_linked still true (we haven't detached yet), dispatch_slot_available true after previous execute (step43 made slot available), not dispatch_allocated ?candidate (true). Good.)
(After allocate, we set dispatch_allocated true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked true, not dispatch_slot_available.)
(Now execute_schedule_dispatch requires dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatched ?candidate. All true.)
(Effect: dispatched ?candidate, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot.)
(Now after execute, we release operator and compliance certificate and detach tp.)
(Now we need to ensure we didn't violate any negative preconditions like not dispatched earlier etc.)
