(- destination: used vehicle_unit_beta (step10). After step24 execute destination dispatch, vehicle_unit_beta becomes available.)
(- shift_alpha: used vehicle_unit_gamma (step32). After step43 execute schedule dispatch, vehicle_unit_gamma becomes available.)
(- shift_beta: used vehicle_unit_alpha again (step49). After step59 execute schedule dispatch, vehicle_unit_alpha becomes available again.)
(Thus we never have two simultaneous allocations of same vehicle; fine.)
(Operator usage:)
